ption</a:Key><a:Value>azcmagent (optional) may be spoofed by an attacker and this may lead to unauthorized access to Hybrid Identity. Consider using a standard authentication mechanism to identify the source process.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>HTTPS</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>143400a1-41b1-4794-aba1-9f5777433278</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>d54e92b4-2e13-41d6-85da-5fc8d62f76c6</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>S1</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>R6143400a1-41b1-4794-aba1-9f5777433278e216e1ec-7594-4752-ac55-4a243c35dffad54e92b4-2e13-41d6-85da-5fc8d62f76c6</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>f2963659-3f3c-4bde-aadb-d2b6df386b61</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>e216e1ec-7594-4752-ac55-4a243c35dffa</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>56</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>143400a1-41b1-4794-aba1-9f5777433278:e216e1ec-7594-4752-ac55-4a243c35dffa:d54e92b4-2e13-41d6-85da-5fc8d62f76c6</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Data Repudiation by Hybrid Identity</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatShortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Repudiation threats involve an adversary denying that something happened.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Hybrid Identity claims that it did not receive data from a source outside the trust boundary. Consider using logging or auditing to record the source, time, and summary of the received data.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>HTTPS</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>143400a1-41b1-4794-aba1-9f5777433278</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>d54e92b4-2e13-41d6-85da-5fc8d62f76c6</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>R6</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D3143400a1-41b1-4794-aba1-9f5777433278e216e1ec-7594-4752-ac55-4a243c35dffad54e92b4-2e13-41d6-85da-5fc8d62f76c6</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>f2963659-3f3c-4bde-aadb-d2b6df386b61</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>e216e1ec-7594-4752-ac55-4a243c35dffa</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>57</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>143400a1-41b1-4794-aba1-9f5777433278:e216e1ec-7594-4752-ac55-4a243c35dffa:d54e92b4-2e13-41d6-85da-5fc8d62f76c6</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for Hybrid Identity</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key><a:Value>Denial Of Service</a: